Downloaded on request (not bundled)
  Kokoro-82M model and voices, by hexgrad, Apache-2.0
    https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
    fetched from https://github.com/mlalma/KokoroTestApp when you choose to download
    the natural voices in Settings → Reading.
  Parakeet Ultra speech model, by Moondream, retrained from NVIDIA's parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3, CC-BY-4.0
    https://huggingface.co/moondream/parakeet-ultra
    Core ML build https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/parakeet-ultra-coreml
  Parakeet CTC 110M (spots names from the screen), by NVIDIA, CC-BY-4.0
    https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/parakeet-ctc-110m-coreml
    Both fetched when you choose Parakeet in Settings → Dictation.

Apple frameworks used through the macOS SDK (Vision, Speech, ScreenCaptureKit, AVFoundation,
